			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 100040601,
					"content": "Phew, that's that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100040602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100040602,
					"content": "Well, the old hag said to open the third letter once it was all said and done.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100040603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 100040603,
					"content": "But, I couldn't make it work. So... should I still open it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100040604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 100040604,
					"content": "Hmm. Y'know, Paimon thinks she understands your dynamic a lot better now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100040605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100040605,
					"content": "Look, she didn't say you had to *successfully* complete the ceremony, so you can open it. It'll be fine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100040606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100040606,
					"content": "Huh, I guess. All the same, I doubt she has anything nice to say.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100040607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 100040607,
					"content": "\"If you're reading this, it means you attempted to open the Sign of Truth.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100040608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbeloth"
				},
				{
					"id": 100040608,
					"content": "\"...Hahahaha. Seriously? I can't believe you actually tried it!\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100040609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbeloth"
				},
				{
					"id": 100040609,
					"content": "What are you laughing at, you old hag!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100040610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 100040610,
					"content": "\"Khaenri'ah was home to several lakes of stars, rendering the fabric of space in that area comparatively unstable. As a result, attempts to break through the firmament through non-physical means were more likely to succeed.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100040611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbeloth"
				},
				{
					"id": 100040611,
					"content": "\"In any case, I knew this place was well-hidden and wouldn't be frequented by too many people. As such, any negative effects of failing to open the Sign of Truth would remain small-scale.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100040612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbeloth"
				},
				{
					"id": 100040612,
					"content": "\"And of course, as my student, I felt sure you would have the chops to deal with the Abyssal creatures that roam beyond the false sky.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100040613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbeloth"
				},
				{
					"id": 100040613,
					"content": "\"Even if you couldn't beat them, I am certain you could out-run them. You always were fast on your feet.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100040614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbeloth"
				},
				{
					"id": 100040614,
					"content": "\"Ah, connecting hydromancy to the kind of wisdom that quenches 'thirst'... Truly, my genius knows no bounds.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100040615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbeloth"
				},
				{
					"id": 100040615,
					"content": "\"The practical application of the Scryglass has also reduced disturbances caused by the false sky. Hah, I'd like to see Alice try and top that!\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100040616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Barbeloth"
				},
				{
					"id": 100040616,
					"content": "Mona cuts it off there — apparently, the old hag proceeds to brag for a further few thousand words.\\n\\nAfter sorting through the observation results, you all return to Mondstadt.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		}
	]
}